     );
+    // `/configuracoes`'s `GoRoute.builder` resolves `sl<AccountSettingsCubit>
+    // ()` (Story 2.4) — same rationale as `AuthCubit` above, wired to the
+    // same fake repository `pumpRouter` passes into `buildAppRouter` so a
